 del sapo para obtener el mayor puntaje posible dentro del tablero, tal como en el juego original.\n\nEl juego recrea diferentes variaciones locales de Sapo/Rana de varios pa\u00edses (Colombia, Ecuador, Per\u00fa, Chile, Bolivia, Argentina y Espa\u00f1a), utilizando controles inmersivos de realidad virtual y f\u00edsicas realistas.\n\nEs un juego casual, muy intuitivo y f\u00e1cil de aprender, pero muy desafiante. Perfecto para sesiones cortas y entretenidas.", "short_description": "Juego tradicional latinoamericano de Sapo/Rana, recreado en realidad virtual."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logoA.png", "id": "9839896699447905", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830599_9839896702781238_613105640565704282_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FHn4t8nKSpYQ7kNvwG4_H9B&_nc_oc=Adpw-pUa9njeXnuAiIgYjoA5c1Ab_GSQkn03hh1BgfwQviPaQ6KNKUFngJnf2dcWV6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzgF5tK436TFEy-m5TZL4AY6I80Nh5LfAujD1Six28KDg&oe=69C14EDF"}, {"file_name": "heroBannerA.png", "id": "1794159114515101", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1794159117848434_2751359420875154132_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5tM3I_XjviUQ7kNvwGW2JPE&_nc_oc=AdpqoA75CAg8IkKnt3dqB7QrN4NYLvHN_zeF4UUD0jWkSkeWU3vCH6vYiNSbUrngxg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyl3uKLrOcdEfoIznlke1SJYPE-Sei3_cG8CQ-s5NsTig&oe=69C14417"}, {"file_name": "coverPortraitA.png", "id": "1408748950397799", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827286_1408748953731132_5797070038261668932_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JB6rbpHOYgYQ7kNvwFrHCmb&_nc_oc=AdogYXrBjbcePDc9d_4NOFke_dy1z4Oi9iNfMycVFzLnBJY0xa-g_TK7ag3FlNndfs4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzZGoGb35DxKDST6egsTVVFQjm3bvH01kXM4O_6Ky0PdA&oe=6